  - key: AMULET_FEATURE_UNLOCKED_UBERTIP
    values:
    - Harvest the <color=#FFD500>Soul</color> of the <color=#FFD500>Legendary Dragon</color> to unleash the ancient power of the <color=#FFD500>Souls Tree</color>!
    - Ernte die <color=#FFD500>Seele</color> des <color=#FFD500>Legendären Drachen</color>, um die uralte Kraft des <color=#FFD500>Baums der Seelen</color> zu entfesseln!
    - ¡Cosecha el <color=#FFD500>alma</color> del <color=#FFD500>dragón legendario</color> para liberar el poder ancestral del <color=#FFD500>árbol de almas</color>!
    - Récolte l'<color=#FFD500>Âme</color> du <color=#FFD500>Dragon légendaire</color> pour libérer l'antique pouvoir de l'<color=#FFD500>Arbre des âmes</color> !
    - Raccogli l'<color=#FFD500>Anima</color> del <color=#FFD500>Drago leggendario</color> per liberare l'antico potere dell'<color=#FFD500>Albero delle anime</color>!
    - '<color=#FFD500>レジェンダリードラゴン</color>の<color=#FFD500>魂</color>を収穫し、<color=#FFD500>魂の木</color>の古の力を解き放て！'
    - '<color=#FFD500>전설의 용</color>의 <color=#FFD500>영혼</color>을 수확해 <color=#FFD500>영혼 나무</color>의 고대 힘을 해방하라!'
    - Zbierz <color=#FFD500>Duszę</color> <color=#FFD500>Legendarnego Smoka</color>, by uwolnić pradawną moc <color=#FFD500>Drzewa Dusz</color>!
    - Colete a <color=#FFD500>Alma</color> do <color=#FFD500>Dragão Lendário</color> para liberar o poder ancestral da <color=#FFD500>Árvore das Almas</color>!
    - Собери <color=#FFD500>душу</color> <color=#FFD500>легендарного дракона</color>, чтобы высвободить древнюю мощь <color=#FFD500>Древа душ</color>!
    - '<color=#FFD500>Efsanevi Ejderhanın</color> <color=#FFD500>Ruhunu</color> topla ve <color=#FFD500>Ruh Ağacı</color>nın kadim gücünü serbest bırak!'
    - Збери <color=#FFD500>Душу</color> <color=#FFD500>Легендарного дракона</color>, щоб вивільнити прадавню силу <color=#FFD500>Древа душ</color>!
    - 收割<color=#FFD500>传说巨龙</color>的<color=#FFD500>灵魂</color>，释放<color=#FFD500>灵魂之树</color>的远古之力！
