    - "정동석을 {geodes}개 더 <color=#FFD500>열어</color>\r\n<color=#FFD500>크리스탈</color>을 되살리세요"
    - "<color=#FFD500>Otwórz</color> jeszcze {geodes} geod,\r\naby odrodzić <color=#FFD500>Kryształ</color>"
    - "<color=#FFD500>Abra</color> mais {geodes} geodos\npara fazer o <color=#FFD500>Cristal</color> reaparecer"
