  - key: GRAPH_ZERO_COOLDOWN_DESCRIPTION
    values:
    - On kill, consumes all <color=#FFD500>Charges</color> of this <color=#FFD500>Spawner</color>, multiplying the <color=#FFD500>Stats</color> and <color=#FFD500>Souls</color> by the number of consumed <color=#FFD500>Charges</color>. Does not affect <color=#FFD500>Spawners</color> with <color=#FFD500>Equipment</color>.
    - Verbraucht bei einem Kill alle <color=#FFD500>Ladungen</color> dieses <color=#FFD500>Spawners</color> und multipliziert <color=#FFD500>Werte</color> und <color=#FFD500>Seelen</color> mit der Anzahl der verbrauchten <color=#FFD500>Ladungen</color>. Betrifft keine <color=#FFD500>Spawner</color> mit <color=#FFD500>Ausrüstung</color>.
    - Al matar, consume todas las <color=#FFD500>Cargas</color> de este <color=#FFD500>Generador</color>, multiplicando las <color=#FFD500>Estadísticas</color> y las <color=#FFD500>Almas</color> por la cantidad de <color=#FFD500>Cargas</color> consumidas. No afecta a los <color=#FFD500>Generadores</color> con <color=#FFD500>Equipamiento</color>.
    - À chaque élimination, consomme toutes les <color=#FFD500>Charges</color> de ce <color=#FFD500>Générateur</color> et multiplie les <color=#FFD500>Stats</color> et les <color=#FFD500>Âmes</color> par le nombre de <color=#FFD500>Charges</color> consommées. N'affecte pas les <color=#FFD500>Générateurs</color> avec de l'<color=#FFD500>Équipement</color>.
    - A ogni uccisione consuma tutte le <color=#FFD500>Cariche</color> di questo <color=#FFD500>Generatore</color>, moltiplicando le <color=#FFD500>Statistiche</color> e le <color=#FFD500>Anime</color> per le <color=#FFD500>Cariche</color> consumate. Non influenza i <color=#FFD500>Generatori</color> con <color=#FFD500>Equipaggiamento</color>.
    - 敵を倒すと、この<color=#FFD500>スポナー</color>のすべての<color=#FFD500>チャージ</color>を消費し、消費した<color=#FFD500>チャージ</color>数に応じて<color=#FFD500>ステータス</color>と<color=#FFD500>ソウル</color>を倍増させる。<color=#FFD500>装備</color>をドロップする<color=#FFD500>スポナー</color>には影響しない。
    - 처치 시 이 <color=#FFD500>스포너</color>의 모든 <color=#FFD500>충전</color>을 소모하고, 소모한 <color=#FFD500>충전</color> 수만큼 <color=#FFD500>능력치</color>와 <color=#FFD500>영혼</color>을 배가합니다. <color=#FFD500>장비</color>를 드롭하는 <color=#FFD500>스포너</color>에는 적용되지 않습니다.
    - Przy zabiciu zużywa wszystkie <color=#FFD500>Ładunki</color> tego <color=#FFD500>Generatora</color>, mnożąc <color=#FFD500>Statystyki</color> i <color=#FFD500>Dusze</color> przez liczbę zużytych <color=#FFD500>Ładunków</color>. Nie działa na <color=#FFD500>Generatory</color> z <color=#FFD500>Ekwipunkiem</color>.
    - Ao eliminar, consome todas as <color=#FFD500>Cargas</color> deste <color=#FFD500>Gerador</color>, multiplicando os <color=#FFD500>Atributos</color> e as <color=#FFD500>Almas</color> pelo número de <color=#FFD500>Cargas</color> consumidas. Não afeta <color=#FFD500>Geradores</color> com <color=#FFD500>Equipamento</color>.
    - При убийстве поглощает все <color=#FFD500>заряды</color> этого <color=#FFD500>спавнера</color>, умножая <color=#FFD500>статы</color> и <color=#FFD500>души</color> на количество поглощенных <color=#FFD500>зарядов</color>. Не затрагивает <color=#FFD500>спавнеры</color> с <color=#FFD500>экипировкой</color>.
    - Öldürünce bu <color=#FFD500>Doğurucunun</color> tüm <color=#FFD500>Yüklerini</color> tüketir; <color=#FFD500>İstatistikleri</color> ve <color=#FFD500>Ruhları</color> tüketilen <color=#FFD500>Yük</color> sayısıyla çarpar. <color=#FFD500>Ekipman</color> içeren <color=#FFD500>Doğurucuları</color> etkilemez.
    - За вбивство витрачає всі <color=#FFD500>Заряди</color> цього <color=#FFD500>Спавнера</color>, множачи <color=#FFD500>Характеристики</color> й <color=#FFD500>Душі</color> на кількість витрачених <color=#FFD500>Зарядів</color>. Не діє на <color=#FFD500>Спавнери</color> з <color=#FFD500>Екіпіруванням</color>.
    - 击杀时消耗该<color=#FFD500>刷怪点</color>的所有<color=#FFD500>充能</color>，并根据消耗的<color=#FFD500>充能</color>数量倍增<color=#FFD500>属性</color>和<color=#FFD500>灵魂</color>。不影响掉落<color=#FFD500>装备</color>的<color=#FFD500>刷怪点</color>。
