  - key: ISLAND_MEDAL_DESCRIPTION
    values:
    - You have completely cleared <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> for today<br><br> <color=#FFD500>New Medal</color> achieved!
    - Du hast <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> für heute vollständig gesäubert<br><br> <color=#FFD500>Neue Medaille</color> erreicht!
    - Has despejado por completo <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> por hoy<br><br> ¡Has conseguido una <color=#FFD500>nueva medalla</color>!
    - Tu as entièrement nettoyé <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> pour aujourd'hui<br><br> <color=#FFD500>Nouvelle médaille</color> obtenue !
    - Hai ripulito completamente <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> per oggi<br><br> Hai ottenuto una <color=#FFD500>nuova medaglia</color>!
    - 今日は<color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color>を完全に制覇しました<br><br> <color=#FFD500>新しいメダル</color>を獲得！
    - 오늘 <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color>을(를) 완전히 정리했습니다<br><br> <color=#FFD500>새 메달</color> 획득!
    - Całkowicie oczyszczono dziś <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color><br><br> Zdobyto <color=#FFD500>nowy medal</color>!
    - Você concluiu totalmente <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> por hoje<br><br> <color=#FFD500>Nova Medalha</color> conquistada!
    - Вы полностью зачистили <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> на сегодня<br><br> Получена <color=#FFD500>новая медаль</color>!
    - '<color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> bugün tamamen temizlendi<br><br> <color=#FFD500>Yeni Madalya</color> kazanıldı!'
    - Ви повністю зачистили <color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color> на сьогодні<br><br> Отримано <color=#FFD500>нову медаль</color>!
    - 你今天已彻底清理<color=#FFD500>{island_name}</color><br><br>获得<color=#FFD500>新勋章</color>！
