  - key: SHOP_CHESTS_INFO_TIP
    values:
    - Increase <color=#FFD500>Chest Level</color> via every <color=#FFD500>VIP level</color> and in the <color=#FFD500>Souls Tree</color>
    - Erhöhe die <color=#FFD500>Truhenstufe</color> über jede <color=#FFD500>VIP-Stufe</color> und im <color=#FFD500>Seelenbaum</color>
    - Aumenta el <color=#FFD500>nivel de cofre</color> con cada <color=#FFD500>nivel VIP</color> y en el <color=#FFD500>árbol de almas</color>
    - Augmente le <color=#FFD500>niveau de coffre</color> à chaque <color=#FFD500>niveau VIP</color> et dans l'<color=#FFD500>Arbre des âmes</color>
    - Aumenta il <color=#FFD500>livello del forziere</color> con ogni <color=#FFD500>livello VIP</color> e nell'<color=#FFD500>Albero delle anime</color>
    - '<color=#FFD500>VIPレベル</color>ごとと<color=#FFD500>魂の木</color>で<color=#FFD500>チェストレベル</color>を上げよう'
    - 각 <color=#FFD500>VIP 레벨</color>과 <color=#FFD500>영혼 나무</color>에서 <color=#FFD500>상자 레벨</color>을 높이세요
    - Zwiększaj <color=#FFD500>poziom skrzyni</color> z każdym <color=#FFD500>poziomem VIP</color> i w <color=#FFD500>Drzewie Dusz</color>
    - Aumente o <color=#FFD500>nível do baú</color> a cada <color=#FFD500>nível VIP</color> e na <color=#FFD500>Árvore das Almas</color>
    - Повышайте <color=#FFD500>уровень сундуков</color> с каждым <color=#FFD500>VIP-уровнем</color> и в <color=#FFD500>Древе душ</color>
    - Her <color=#FFD500>VIP seviyesi</color> ve <color=#FFD500>Ruh Ağacı</color> ile <color=#FFD500>Sandık Seviyeni</color> artır
    - Підвищуй <color=#FFD500>рівень скрині</color> з кожним <color=#FFD500>VIP-рівнем</color> та в <color=#FFD500>Древі душ</color>
    - 通过每个<color=#FFD500>VIP 等级</color>和<color=#FFD500>灵魂之树</color>提升<color=#FFD500>宝箱等级</color>
